OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after Islamic
OL,4,Abuildings graffitied
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man from Forest Gate,
OL,7,Feast London, has been charged after
OL,8,Ffive Islamic buildings were sprayed
OL,9,Fwith offensive graffiti in January last
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FIllia Bilyk has been charged with
OL,13,Fracially and religiously-aggravated
OL,14,Fcriminal damage.
OL,16,FThe religious venues targeted included
OL,17,Fthe Al-Birr Mosque and the Noor Ul
OL,18,FIslam Primary School, both in Leyton,
OL,19,Feast London.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
