OL,4,Abuildings graffitied
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Sup Rhona Hunt, who leads policing
OL,7,Fin the area, said: "We recognise that
OL,8,Fthese incidents caused significant
OL,9,Fdistress within Muslim communities
OL,10,Facross east London last year and that
OL,11,Fthey continue to cause concern."
